{"id": "clm:b0906a8d0b9b46f0163c5311e19ed7b3add6033420b24e6b0b884521013b439d", "type": "statement", "text": "VisuaLeaf reports that a matching aggregation without command-level maxTimeMS failed with \"operation exceeded time limit\" under a stored 1 ms budget, then completed after removing the setting. The experiment used MongoDB 9.0.2 and FCV 9.0. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-09)", "source_url": "https://visualeaf.com/blog/mongodb-9-0-whats-new/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape queryKnobs and maxTimeMS (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fd73b9bf6c54fe6dbe60964d304286d3c0e9bd608f7f9b63b5f0527e8da839ce", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:616d8217d3e7244e75158ff3a6714eea789383c5be749620d75ae67e5cbfacc1", "ev:993ed6fa6904fd4844054e721531ef4c1279a963c8e08a8a9c4e9abfd2421e7d"]}
