{"id": "clm:568ff067f7d7272e721e366a0f631f9ceb6b2514b3b33a02d2fe42aebdc949e1", "type": "statement", "text": "Per-shape knob values override instance-wide parameters and compiled defaults, and apply cluster-wide to the matching shape. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape queryKnobs and maxTimeMS (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fd73b9bf6c54fe6dbe60964d304286d3c0e9bd608f7f9b63b5f0527e8da839ce", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:af2ee18b68ce1569b453b4844fb25779999f2ea0972968309117806a1ecc8f28"]}
{"id": "clm:6faec6fff6413723872f8017a5caae1f3babecff4e2ffd639ab659e326a292e1", "type": "statement", "text": "queryKnobs updates merge individual knobs; omitted knobs remain unchanged, an empty document does nothing, and null removes one override. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Per-shape queryKnobs and maxTimeMS (9.0)"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-123662"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fd73b9bf6c54fe6dbe60964d304286d3c0e9bd608f7f9b63b5f0527e8da839ce", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:4f8417f1fa9c1c743e11469b4239009da1e1707357cbef4c0306eb7fc47e4017"]}
